window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> bestseller Morgan Rice, whose books have over 10,000 five-star ratings, comes the second book in a spectacular new fantasy series, </b><b><i>Deathborn</i></b><b>, ideal for fans of Rebecca Yarros, Callie Hart, and Carissa Broadbent. The series begins with </b><b><i>Veiled </i></b><b>(the first book in The Deathborn Series).</b></p> <p><b>At Greyveil Academy, Elara Gray’s necromantic powers draw her deeper into a world of secrets and danger. </b><br> <br> Strange magical disturbances threaten the fragile veil between life and death, forcing her to team up with the brooding Deathborn Darian and the captivating Luminary Orion. An ancient text hints at a prophecy tying Elara’s abilities to the academy’s fate, while her mother’s locket reveals cryptic clues about a hidden past.<br> <br> As tensions rise and alliances shift, Elara must navigate her conflicting feelings and unravel the mysteries before darkness consumes both realms.<br> <br> <b>Will Elara master her powers in time to save Greyveil?</b><br> <br> Seductive romance meets supernatural intrigue in a high-stakes world where mortality's boundaries fade and forbidden power awaits those willing to pay its terrible price. As enemies become reluctant lovers amidst ancient magic and deadly political games, morally complex characters must navigate their darkest desires and dangerous alliances—challenging listeners to question how much they would sacrifice for power that transcends the veil between life and death.<br> <br> Future books in the series are available!</p>"; 
